sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(React)
    participant API as API<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant S3
    participant Worker as Celery Worker
    participant Parse as PDF Parser<br/>(PyMuPDF)
    participant Extract as Skill Extractor<br/>(taxonomy + fuzzy)
    participant Embed as Embedding Service<br/>(sentence-transformers)
    participant Vector as Vector Store<br/>(FAISS / pgvector)
    participant LLM as LLM Client<br/>(OpenAI / Bedrock)
    participant Metrics as Prometheus

    User->>+FE: Upload resume.pdf + job description
    FE->>+API: POST /api/v1/analyses<br/>multipart/form-data

    note over API: Rate-limit check (slowapi)<br/>10 req/min per IP

    API->>API: Validate file type (PDF only)<br/>Validate size (≤ 10 MB)
    API->>DB: INSERT analysis (status=processing)
    DB-->>API: analysis.id (UUID)
    API->>S3: PUT resume/{id}.pdf (optional)

    note over API,Worker: Sync path (default) — no Celery

    API->>+Parse: parse_pdf(bytes)
    Parse-->>-API: text, sections dict

    API->>+Extract: extract_skills(resume_text, jd_text)
    Extract->>Extract: taxonomy lookup (O(1) trie)
    Extract->>Extract: alias expansion
    Extract->>Extract: fuzzy match (rapidfuzz, threshold 85)
    Extract-->>-API: matched_skills[], missing_skills[]

    API->>+Embed: embed(resume_chunks + jd_chunks)
    Embed->>Embed: sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2<br/>or OpenAI / Titan (config-driven)
    Embed-->>-API: embeddings (384-dim or 1536-dim)

    API->>+Vector: similarity_search(jd_embedding, k=5)
    note over Vector: RAG — retrieve top-k JD chunks<br/>for grounding LLM feedback
    Vector-->>-API: context_chunks[]

    API->>API: compute_scores()<br/>• semantic_score = cosine_sim(resume_emb, jd_emb) × 100<br/>• skill_score = matched / total × 100<br/>• experience_score = section heuristic<br/>• overall = 0.5×semantic + 0.3×skill + 0.2×experience

    API->>+LLM: chat_completion(prompt_v2, context_chunks)
    note over LLM: Prompt includes: resume text, JD,<br/>scores, RAG context, scoring rubric
    LLM-->>-API: LLMFeedback (JSON)<br/>summary, strengths, gaps,<br/>ats_warnings, recommended_keywords

    API->>Metrics: ANALYSIS_DURATION.observe(elapsed)<br/>LLM_TOKENS.inc(prompt_tokens, kind="prompt")<br/>LLM_TOKENS.inc(completion_tokens, kind="completion")

    API->>DB: UPDATE analysis SET status=completed,<br/>scores, skills, llm_feedback, tokens_used
    DB-->>API: ok
    API-->>-FE: 201 AnalysisResponse (JSON)
    FE-->>-User: Display score dashboard<br/>Matched/missing skills<br/>LLM feedback + suggestions

    note over API,Metrics: On failure:<br/>analysis_failures_total.inc(reason=...)<br/>record.status = "failed"
